Package: tovinci
Version: 3.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: awesomeshot5051 englandtechnologies@gmail.com
Depends: python3, ffmpeg
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Convert media into DaVinci Resolve friendly formats
 tovinci converts video to DNxHR, ProRes or H.264, audio to WAV and images
 to JPEG using ffmpeg. It can combine clips, resume long jobs and estimate
 output size with a dry run.
